Third-party material
====================

1. Task sources of the task set lcbench-v1 (Apache License 2.0)

The task packages of the task set lcbench-v1 (the release assets <task>-warm.tar.gz and <task>-no_hint.tar.gz)
contain Lean source files from the following repositories, each at the pinned commit below. Each repository is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy of the license is in the file LICENSE-Apache-2.0. None of these
repositories has a NOTICE file at the pinned commit.

| task | upstream repository | pinned commit |
|---|---|---|
| ramsey96 | https://github.com/openai/ten-proofs | 94bc0feb6a9ff12c7d31d6de640a725c9d43d2b6 |
| permanent2 | https://github.com/openai/ten-proofs | 94bc0feb6a9ff12c7d31d6de640a725c9d43d2b6 |
| compactness5 | https://github.com/openai/ten-proofs | 94bc0feb6a9ff12c7d31d6de640a725c9d43d2b6 |
| slt26 | https://github.com/YuanheZ/lean-stat-learning-theory | d0f506f0a695018265dccb33bcb05e2f5ca1c876 |
| slt49 | https://github.com/YuanheZ/lean-stat-learning-theory | d0f506f0a695018265dccb33bcb05e2f5ca1c876 |
| mathlib197 | https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4 | 81a5d257c8e410db227a6665ed08f64fea08e997 |
| mathlib372 | https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4 | 81a5d257c8e410db227a6665ed08f64fea08e997 |

Each task's files are listed, with their sha256, in tasks/<task>/task_source.json of the MathCompressionBench repository (the
`editable` entries and their `fetch` URLs). The repository itself does not contain these files: `mcb make-task`
downloads them from the URLs above and checks their sha256.

Changes made to the files:

- The warm packages contain the files unchanged.
- The no_hint packages replace the proofs of the target theorems with `sorry`; the statements and every other part
  of the files are unchanged. In mathlib197 and mathlib372, the target proofs that are a bare `rfl` and that later
  declarations of the same files need as definitional lemmas are kept (25 in mathlib197, 54 in mathlib372); each
  package's TASK.json lists them under `no_hint.rfl_proofs_kept`.

2. Task sources of the task set oai-v1 (Apache License 2.0)

The task packages of the task set oai-v1 (the release assets oai-<task>-warm.tar.gz) contain Lean source files from
https://github.com/openai/math at commit adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a (its lean/ folder), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy of the license is in the file LICENSE-Apache-2.0. The repository has no NOTICE
file at that commit. Each task's files are listed, with their URL at that commit and their sha256, in
tasks/<task>/task_source.json of the MathCompressionBench repository (the `editable` entries and their `fetch` URLs).
The repository itself does not contain these files: `mcb make-task` downloads them from those URLs and checks their
sha256.

Changes made to the files:

- The packages contain the files unchanged, under project/.
- project/lake-manifest.json of each package is the upstream's lean/lake-manifest.json, and project/lakefile.toml is
  derived from the upstream's lean/lakefile.lean (its `require` lines and Lean options).

3. Lean 4 (Apache License 2.0)

lean/LcbenchTools/BudgetReplay.lean (also in every task package, as .benchmark/tools/LcbenchTools/BudgetReplay.lean)
contains `Lean.Environment.replay` from Lean 4 v4.32.0 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4, src/Lean/Replay.lean,
Copyright (c) 2023 Kim Morrison), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, changed so that each declaration is
checked with a kernel heartbeat limit; the file says what changed.
